# Title: WMIC Remote Command Execution
# ID: 7773b877-5abb-4a3e-b9c9-fd0369b59b00
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: frack113, Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2023-02-14
# Tags: attack.execution, attack.t1047
# Description: Detects the execution of WMIC to query information on a remote system
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((((process.command_line:*/node:* OR process.command_line:*-node:*)) AND ((process.executable:*\\WMIC.exe) OR (process.pe.original_file_name:"wmic.exe"))) AND NOT (((process.command_line:*localhost* OR process.command_line:*127.0.0.1*))))
